   "script": "; The timer's work: a new reading, a point on each line, and one\n; AxBindSync() so every bound card and gauge shows it.\nTick() {\n    global cpu, mem, users, traffic, statCpu, statMem, statUsers\n    cpu := Max(3, Min(97, cpu + Random(-9, 9)))\n    mem := Max(20, Min(95, mem + Random(-3, 3)))\n    users += Random(-4, 9)\n    traffic.Push(Random(60, 130))\n    statCpu.Push(Round(cpu)), statMem.Push(Round(mem)), statUsers.Push(users)\n    AxBindSync()\n}\nClock() {\n    global g\n    g.Status(\"clock\", FormatTime(, \"HH:mm:ss\"))\n}",
